This module is the Responses <-> Chat Completions translation of codex-lb, taken
for the "own AI" gateway of the CanonKeeper desktop app:

  source:  https://github.com/Dirard/codex-lb (fork of https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb)
  commit:  656687fb2924a896a3ce4ed89dd4178c0df4c3da
  files:   internal/adapters/upstream -> internal/provider/
           internal/adapters/wirejson -> internal/wirejson/

Parts of the translation are derived from codex-relay
(https://github.com/MetaFARS/codex-relay), and internal/think/ is a port of its
src/think.rs (commit 8491f16) with its tests.

